# Climb camera death line (D-054): walk into the bottomless 3-wide cleft
# after the start terrace (surface row 24, feet y 384). The camera follows
# the fall at most 80 px below the terrace's framing (camera y 236 -> 316),
# so she dies when her hitbox top passes the screen bottom (y 496),
# far above the level bottom (y 640),
# without ever landing. The replay ends while she is still dying.
level  = climb_test
source = handwritten
expect = dies_at frames=151..151 deaths=1 state=dying player_y>=496 player_y<=499
expect = no_event=Landed
